// Parsed once from docs/診断結果マスタ.xlsx (20 sheets: 赤/白/黄色 = 5 seals each in
// columns C-G, 青い夜/青い手/青い猿/青い鷲/青い嵐 = 1 seal each in column C). Seals are matched
// by name against mayaData.SEALS, not by column position, since the source sheet's column
// order doesn't follow the app's canonical seal index order.
//
// Data-quality fixes applied during parsing (see CLAUDE.md for the full story):
// - index 0 ("赤い龍" in mayaData.ts) is spelled "赤い竜" in the source workbook. Treated as
//   authoritative here — mayaData.ts's SEALS[0].name was updated to match. If this was in
//   fact a typo in the source workbook, fix it via /admin/content once writes are re-enabled;
//   don't silently revert it in code.
// - The 青い嵐 sheet's row-6/7 *labels* (not the body text) read "青い鷲が喜ぶこと/嫌がること"
//   (copy-paste from the 青い鷲 sheet). Body text (columns actually read here) is correct
//   青い嵐 content — this only affected a label cell that was never captured as data.
// - The 白 sheet's row-10 (性格の強み・要約) cell for 白い風 had a stray "・想いを伝える"
//   fragment glued onto the first real bullet — a duplicate of one of row-6's (が喜ぶこと)
//   bullet items ("・想いを伝えること") left behind by a copy/paste. Removed from row-10 and,
//   per an explicit follow-up request, re-added as its own bullet in row-9
//   (コミュニケーションの課題) instead.
// - 2026-07-30: every cell's blank-line separators ("\n\n", used both between bullet-list
//   items and between prose paragraphs) were collapsed to a single "\n" throughout the whole
//   workbook, per an explicit request — a dated backup of the pre-collapse version is kept at
//   docs/診断結果マスタ.backup-2026-07-30.xlsx. Single "\n" still renders as separate lines
//   wherever the frontend uses `white-space: pre-line` (see pages/result.vue), so no template
//   changes were needed for this.
// - 2026-07-30: renamed from "seal profile" to "character" (file, Firestore doc IDs
//   `sun-{i}` → `character-{i}`, `type: 'sun'` → `type: 'character'`) per an explicit request —
//   this profile is read for every place a seal appears (太陽の紋章/ウェイブスペル today), not
//   just "the sun", so a per-context name was misleading. The separate `wavespell-{i}` doc type
//   was dropped entirely in the same change (was unused placeholder content — see
//   composables/useDiagnosisContent.ts). This is purely a CMS/Firestore naming change — the
//   underlying Maya-calendar domain vocabulary (SEALS/sealIndex in utils/mayaData.ts and
//   utils/mayaCalc.ts) is untouched and intentionally still "seal", since that's the correct
//   term for the calendar concept itself.
// - 2026-08-05: 診断結果マスタの各シートは「1〜14行目は無料、15行目以降は有料」という設計だった
//   ため、この境界に合わせて紋章プロフィールの無料/有料範囲を修正した(元々は総合解説/あなたはこんな
//   人以外を全てライトプラン以上の有料表示にしてしまっていた — pages/result.vue参照)。row5〜13の
//   フィールド(careerPath〜cautionSummary)は無料に、row18以降(practicalTips〜luckDownHabits)は
//   引き続き有料のまま。cautionDetailだけはxlsx上でrow14(無料)とrow15(有料)の2セルにまたがってお
//   り、旧cautionDetailフィールドはこの2セルを"\n\n"区切りで連結したものだった(他の全セル内の空
//   行区切りは前述の通り"\n"1個に統一済みなので、"\n\n"は行14/15境界の目印として温存されていた)。
//   このマーカーを使ってcautionDetailを前半(無料・row14)とcautionDetailPremium(有料・row15)に分
//   割した。例外はindex 7(黄色い星)で、xlsxのrow14セル自体が空欄だったためマーカーが存在せず、既存
//   のcautionDetail全文をそのままcautionDetailPremiumに移し、cautionDetailは空文字にした(このキャ
//   ラクターだけ無料側の「注意すべき傾向」詳細が要約のみになる — マスタ側のデータそのものの欠落であ
//   り、パース時の誤りではない)。
export interface CharacterSeed {
  index: number
  name: string
  archetype: string
  catchphrase: string
  overview: string
  traits: string
  careerPath: string
  likes: string
  dislikes: string
  communicationStrengths: string
  communicationChallenges: string
  strengthsSummary: string
  strengthsDetail: string
  cautionSummary: string
  cautionDetail: string
  cautionDetailPremium: string
  practicalTips: string
  bestEnvironment: string
  bestRole: string
  loveAndPartnership: string
  careerSuccess: string
  luckUpActions: string
  luckDownHabits: string
}

